WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.476
Nder worgo hirnaange Burkina Faso, to Banfora, duniyaaru ɓeydi ɓeydaaki haa duumii.

00:00:06.556 --> 00:00:08.372
Ɗuum woni ɓesngu Sindou.

00:00:08.452 --> 00:00:14.217
Ɗuunɗe, cuuɗi, e fungooji kaaƴe, ɗi ndiyam e hendu mbaɗi nder wakkati fuu.

00:00:14.297 --> 00:00:18.719
Janngooɓe geolooji mbiyi ɗum'en ko ɗum waɗi to ɓe njogii.

00:00:18.799 --> 00:00:23.459
Ammaa to jemma waɗi dow Sindou, mawɓe ɗon mbi'a haala feere.

00:00:23.539 --> 00:00:28.040
Ɓe mbi'i diga ɓooyaare, kaaƴe ɗe'e naa' ko kaaƴeeje goɗɗe.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:33.964
Koomoy nder maɓɓe ɗon jooɗoto nder mayri, kooɗume ɗon ɗowtana ɓernde maako.

00:00:34.044 --> 00:00:47.788
O wi'i yimɓe jooɗiiɓe haa hooseere cembiɗam waɗi alkawal bee ardiiɓe ɓe'e ɓe ngi'ataa, ngam ɓe njooɗoto nder lesdi, ɓe jooɗoto e jam, to ɓe ɗowtani nokkuuje ɗe Allah hokki ɓe.

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:54.107
Ngam maajum, ɓe mbi'i, nokkuuje goɗɗe nder ko'e leɗɗe naa' ɗe yaawata yimɓe fuu.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:59.399
On njaaraay ɗum wakkati fuu, on mbi'aay ɗum, on mbaɗaay ko'e maɓɓe.

00:00:59.479 --> 00:01:07.377
Yimɓe kuuje ɗe'e ɗon kuuwa kuuɗe maɓɓe, ngam ɓe ngaɗana ɓerɗe maɓɓe ko'e maɓɓe ngam ɓe njaɓɓa ndiyam.

00:01:07.457 --> 00:01:17.330
To yimɓe ɗon mbi'a dow ko'e maɓɓe, koo go'o nder kaaƴe maɓɓata ko ɗum waɗi: go'oto warɗo, debbo ɗon hoola, dabbaajo ɗon ɗaana.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:21.042
On fuu on annda ɗum'en, on ɗowtana mawɓe Allah.

00:01:21.122 --> 00:01:27.361
Bana non, sukaaɓe mawɓe dow kooseeje ɓe njanngina ɓe ndaara ɗe bana kaaƴe goɗɗe.

00:01:27.441 --> 00:01:32.654
Hannde, yahooɓe ɗon ngara diga toɗɗaaɗe ngam yi'ugo nokkuure nde'e.

00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:41.658
Mawɓe ɗon anndina ɓe ɓe ɓe ɗon yaha nder nokkuure nduumiije, to ɓalli yimɓe e hakkilantaaku maɓɓe ɗon mbaadi go'o.
